1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,664
Speaking, task three. Story number 6: The lost key. What happened to Mr Vlk yesterday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:12,367 --> 00:00:14,086
What happened to Mr Vlk yesterday?

3
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,967
Yesterday evening Mr Vlk was walking home from work.

4
00:00:37,167 --> 00:00:39,397
He was tired and looking forward to dinner.

5
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,067
When he got to the door, he looked for his key.

6
00:00:42,267 --> 00:00:44,924
He looked in his pocket and his bag, but it wasn't there.

7
00:00:45,133 --> 00:00:46,933
He had probably left it at work.

8
00:00:47,133 --> 00:00:48,892
Mr Vlk didn't know what to do.

9
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:51,033
In the end he called a locksmith.

10
00:00:51,233 --> 00:00:53,163
The locksmith arrived half an hour later.

11
00:00:53,367 --> 00:00:55,067
He opened the door in five minutes.

12
00:00:55,267 --> 00:00:58,431
Mr Vlk had to pay him eight hundred crowns and was sad.

13
00:00:58,633 --> 00:01:06,700
Tell story 6 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
